{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crystal Rail is a handpainted roguelite\u00a0train  RPG, featuring original music by <i>Jordan Chin (Monster Train)</i>! Choose a conductor, make a train, and strike it rich by <i>any</i> means!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a conductor, inspired by an extinct animal, each with a unique power:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/CR_ConductorSelect_Feb162025.gif?t=1740425543\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag cars behind your engine to create a crystal train and set out to strike it rich, <i>by any means necessary!</i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/CR_1Car_Small_Nov2024_v2.gif?t=1740425543\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make deliveries, upgrade your engine, send blackmail, start a\u00a0<strong><i>revolution!</i></strong> It's all fair game if it leaves you on top!  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/CR_DemRev_Jan232025.gif?t=1740425543\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Last one standing wins!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you've yearned for a new spin on the roguelite, a fresh take on steampunk, or if you just want a few more trains in your life, you may find it here on board Crystal Rail! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist now</strong> to join us for the full release later this year! And join our discord for all the latest announcements!<br><br><strong><i>All aboard!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3359330?t=1740425543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740425543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/db4